Third-party components
---------------------------------------------------------------------

`src/vitruvian/lewm_compat/`
    Contains portions of LeWM (Latent-action World Models), originally
    developed by the LeWM authors and distributed under the Apache
    License, Version 2.0. The vendored subset is a minimal,
    interface-preserving copy of the classes Vitruvian depends on
    (``Embedder``, ``ARPredictor``, ``MLP``, ``Transformer`` blocks,
    ``SIGReg``, and the legacy ``JEPA`` composer) with light type
    annotations added. No training loop, dataset loaders, or
    Lightning scaffolding were copied.

    Upstream: https://github.com/lucas-maes/le-wm  (see
    docs/decisions/007-lewm-world-model.md for the adoption rationale).

    The `external/le-wm` submodule was retired in M4.9; `lewm_compat/`
    is the canonical vendored copy. Upstream diffs preserved in
    `docs/archive/lewm_local_edits.patch`.
